        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-9" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-COPY-TO-NFS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;$Origen = &quot;H:\BACKUP_GCABA&quot;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;$Destino = &quot;K:\BACKUP_GCABA&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;RENAME FILE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;C:\scripts\copy_to_nfs_from_SQL.log&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="80" width="210" x="323" y="288" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-11" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-DELETE-H-ALL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK FULL&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;not retention file&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_full_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK DIFF&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;not retention files&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_diff_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK LOG&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;retention of two days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_log_*.bak&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE OTHERS FULL&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;not retention files&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_*_full_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;PURGE OTHERS DIFF&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;not retention files&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_*_diff_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="490" x="323" y="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-DELETE-H-ALL-20251213&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK LOG&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;retention of two days&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_log_*.bak&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE OTHERS FULL&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;not retention files&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_*_full_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;PURGE OTHERS DIFF&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;not retention files&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(51, 51, 51), rgb(193, 193, 193));&quot;&gt;H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_*_diff_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="480" x="323" y="494" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-17" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-PURGE-K-ALL&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK FULL There is a retention file of 4 weeks (28 days)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Delete FULL backups from K:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_full_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK DIFF There is a retention file of 4 weeks (28 days)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Delete DIFF backups from K:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_diff_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE URBETRACK LOG There is a retention of one week&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Delete TLOG (OLDER than 1 week) from K:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_log_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE OTHERS FULL There is a retention of 2 weeks on week (14 days).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Delete FULL backups from K:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_*_full_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;PURGE OTHERS DIFF There is a retention of 1 week on week (1 week).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Delete DIFF backups from K:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_*_diff_*.bak&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="440" x="322" y="579" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-19" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-REPORTE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Save two files on H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp* /O-D &amp;gt; E:\REPORTES\BACKUP_REPORTE_BACKUPS_EN_DISCO.txt and H:\BACKUP_GCABA\urbetrack_*.trn /O-D &amp;gt;&amp;gt; E:\REPORTES\BACKUP_REPORTE_BACKUPS_EN_DISCO.txt&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;This contains a List of all files beginning with bkp, followed by a list of all .trn files matching urbetrack_*.trn**&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Bulk insert into GPL.dbo.BACKUP_REPORTE_BACKUPS_EN_DISCO table&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;Send email to infra@urbetrack.com; geponce62@gmail.com&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="125" width="600" x="-311" y="750" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-20" edge="1" parent="1" source="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.54;entryY=-0.008;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-19">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="13" y="410" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-21" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-RESTO-FULL-DIFF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Set @cifrado&amp;nbsp; for FULL and DIFF backup&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Set week day to take FULL or DIFF depend on the new schedule. If it&#39;s 1Dom 2Lun 4Mie 6Vie we will take FULL if not we will take DIFF.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We take FULL backup for the rest of the databases (not TEMPDB - URBETRACK). We create 3 .bak files per database. We verified the .bak&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We take DIFF backup for the rest of the databases (not MASTER - TEMPDB - URBETRACK). We verified the .bak&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;**&amp;lt;r&amp;gt;The FULL and DIFF backups file are done in H:\BACKUP_GCABA**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Send email to **geponce62@gmail.com** in case of Succeed or Fail with **@file_attachments = &#39;E:\REPORTES\GCABA-BACKUP-RESTO-FULL-DIFF.txt&#39;**&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="150" width="750" x="-784" y="580" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-22" edge="1" parent="1" source="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1.001;entryY=0.307;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-21">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="13" y="410" />
              <mxPoint x="13" y="626" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-24" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-URBETRACK-FULL-DIFF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Execute command on [master] database: **EXEC msdb.dbo.sp_start_job N&#39;GCABA-BACKUP-DELETE-H-ALL&#39;**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Delete everything. The only one with retention is the [URBETRACK] LOG&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Set @cifrado&amp;nbsp; for FULL and DIFF backup&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Set week day to take FULL or DIFF depend on the new schedule.&amp;nbsp;If it&#39;s 7Sab 3Mar 5Jue we will take FULL, if not we will take DIFF.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We take FULL backup of [URBETRACK]database. We create up to 6 .bak files. We verified the .bak&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We take DIFF backup for the rest of the URBETRACK database. We verified the .bak&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;**&amp;lt;r&amp;gt;The FULL and DIFF backups file are done in H:\BACKUP_GCABA**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Reattempt: If we couldn&#39;t take the [URBETRACK] database backup we reattempt until reach the limit. The limit is @HHMM_limite=&#39;05:00&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Send email to **geponce62@gmail.com** in case of Succeed or Fail with **@file_attachments = &#39;E:\REPORTES\GCABA-BACKUP-RESTO-FULL-DIFF.txt&#39;**&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Execute command on [master] database: **EXEC msdb.dbo.sp_start_job N&#39;GCABA-BACKUP-RESTO-FULL-DIFF&#39;**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;**Take FULL and DIFF backup of the rest of the databsaes.**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="750" x="-785" y="346" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-26" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-URBETRACK-FULL-DIFF-20251213&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Execute command on [master] database: **EXEC msdb.dbo.sp_start_job N&#39;GCABA-BACKUP-DELETE-H-ALL&#39;**&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Delete everything. The only one with retention is the [URBETRACK] LOG&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Set @cifrado&amp;nbsp; for FULL and DIFF backup&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Set week day to take FULL or DIFF depend on the new schedule.&amp;nbsp;If it&#39;s 7Sab 3Mar 5Jue we will take FULL, if not we will take DIFF.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We take FULL backup of [URBETRACK]database. We create up to 6 .bak files. We verified the .bak&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;We take DIFF backup for the rest of the URBETRACK database. We verified the .bak&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;**&amp;lt;r&amp;gt;The FULL and DIFF backups file are done in H:\BACKUP_GCABA**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Reattempt: If we couldn&#39;t take the [URBETRACK] database backup we reattempt until reach the limit. The limit is @HHMM_limite=&#39;05:00&#39;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Send email to **geponce62@gmail.com** in case of Succeed or Fail with **@file_attachments = &#39;E:\REPORTES\GCABA-BACKUP-RESTO-FULL-DIFF.txt&#39;**&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;Execute command on [master] database: **EXEC msdb.dbo.sp_start_job N&#39;GCABA-BACKUP-RESTO-FULL-DIFF&#39;**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;**Take FULL and DIFF backup of the rest of the databsaes.**&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="220" width="750" x="-784" y="111" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-27" edge="1" parent="1" source="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1.001;entryY=0.436;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-26">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <Array as="points">
              <mxPoint x="10" y="410" />
              <mxPoint x="10" y="206" />
            </Array>
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-28" edge="1" parent="1" source="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.995;entryY=0.291;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" target="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-24">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TDss8iwTWgiMeGeYR1JO-31" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;fillColor=#f5f5f5;fontColor=#333333;strokeColor=#666666;" value="&lt;b&gt;GCABA-BACKUP-URBETRACK-TLOG&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Execute [URBETRACK] LOG database backup on H:\BACKUP_GCABA\bkp_urbetrack_log_&#39;&#39;+@YYYYMMDD+&#39;&#39;_&#39;&#39;+@HHMMSS+&#39;&#39;.bak" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="720" x="43" y="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
